# Dual license (constitution F21)

This repository uses two licenses, split by directory. This is an index,
not a third license.

| Path | License | File |
|---|---|---|
| `src/` (source code) | Apache-2.0 | [LICENSE-CODE](LICENSE-CODE) |
| `spec/`, `schema/`, `examples/`, `evidence/`, `README.md` (specification, data, docs) | CC BY 4.0 | [LICENSE-DOCS](LICENSE-DOCS) |

**Code (Apache-2.0)**: free use, modification, distribution, patent grant;
must retain notices; changes must be marked; no warranty.

**Docs/data (CC BY 4.0)**: free share and adapt, even commercially;
must give attribution, link the license, and indicate changes; no
additional restrictions; no warranty.

SPDX identifiers appear in each file header. If a file lacks a header,
apply the license of its directory per the table above.

Copyright: GMB-protocol contributors (organizational attribution, no
individual name — constitution F27 / publication-safety rule P2).
